.TH AVR\-TESTS\-VIEW 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-tests-view \- Read one recorded test result and when its failure started.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr tests view
[OPTIONS] RESULT
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read one recorded test result and when its failure started.
.PP
RESULT is a result_id. avr tests search, rank and list print this command under their table for each failed or errored row. Every row's result_id is in their --json output, for example:
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
avr tests search login --status failed --json data -q '.data[].result_id'
.fi
.RE
.PP
It identifies one exact occurrence; a re-run never replaces it with a newer result. The result shows the test, outcome, duration, job, commit and the recorded failure summary.
.PP
For a failed or errored result, the command also checks earlier runs of the same job configuration on the same branch: where the failure started, the last run that passed and how many reports failed since. A commit range is named only as a candidate: it holds the change only when runs on the branch follow commit order. Reports still indexing or unavailable are counted and say why a start could not be named.
.PP
Use --json '*' for the result and its failure_start; failure_start is null when the result did not fail, and is not read when --json leaves it out. Use --web to open the result in the console.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    commit_sha, data, execution_id, failure_start, job_id, organization_id,
    report_finished_at, repository_id, result_id, status
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIRESULT\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Defaults to the configured organization.
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR, \fB\-R\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository (owner/name or rep-ID). Defaults to the current git repository.
.TP
\fB\-\-web\fR
Open in browser.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-tests (1),
.BR avr-tests-history (1),
.BR avr-tests-list (1),
.BR avr-tests-rank (1),
.BR avr-tests-search (1)
